logs/
outputs/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

# --- Exception (2026-08-02): track raw TensorBoard event files for the 15 matrix-v2 runs that
# back the thesis (ctrl/cppo/cppo15 x seeds 1,3,4,52,54) once pulled from the lab PC. Order
# matters here (git uses the LAST matching rule): first re-include the three algorithm dirs so
# git descends into them at all, then blanket re-ignore everything directly under each one
# (this is what stops the other 5 non-selected seeds from leaking back in), then re-include only
# the 15 specific run directories by exact name, then re-exclude checkpoints even inside those.
# Verified with `git add -A` against a throwaway seed dir before relying on this — see run_log.md
# Day 25. See Comparison_test/sync_selected_runs.sh for the matching pull script and
# Comparison_test/final_results/README.md for which runs and why.
!Comparison_test/logs/
!Comparison_test/logs/rsl_rl/
!Comparison_test/logs/rsl_rl/ur5e_lift_ctrl/
!Comparison_test/logs/rsl_rl/ur5e_lift_cppo/
!Comparison_test/logs/rsl_rl/ur5e_lift_cppo15/

Comparison_test/logs/rsl_rl/ur5e_lift_ctrl/*
