# Proprietary fonts used for figure rendering (2026-08-04). Times New Roman is a Monotype
# typeface licensed with Windows: using it to typeset the thesis is fine, redistributing the
# .ttf files via a public repo is not. The files are copied onto each machine by hand.
# Thesis_LaTeX/fonts/README.md is tracked and explains how to obtain them.
